  "description": "PENVOW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C66 H110 Co2 Ho4 N4 O34,4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 5 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.933-4.053 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.78-124.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho4Co2(HL)2(μ3-OCH3)2(piv)8(NO3)2(CH3OH)2]·4H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
